"""Freight forwarding and customs brokerage: quote requests, customs entry preparation and shipment tracking.

Rules for this file: the forwarder sets every margin and sell rate and sends every quote; the assistant shows buy
rates from the rate sheets only. Customs classification and filing stay with the licensed customs broker: the
assistant suggests from the client's past entries, never states a tariff item, duty rate, origin or valuation
decision, and never files. Carrier ETAs are shown as the carrier's estimate, never as a promise. Carriers, vessels
and agencies are invented or generic.
"""
from mk import (D, F, Tbl, Draft, inbox, upload, process, review, X, exceptions, compare, draft, approve, R, write,
                Sec, Chart, report, calendar, case)

